">cozy layers<\/a> that take you effortlessly from studio to street. Each piece is thoughtfully crafted to elevate how you feel, inside and out.<\/p><p>Our <a href=\"\/collections\/pilates-barre-grip-wear\" title=\"Pilates\/Barre Grip Wear\">CoreGrip Pro Pilates Sock<\/a> represents the next evolution of performance footwear. More than a studio essential, it’s a revolution in grip footwear - precision engineered for ultimate stability. Featuring an advanced isometric knit and dual-layer non-slip technology, CoreGrip Pro locks your feet in place for maximum stability on any Pilates apparatus or floor surface. The anatomical left\/right design, inner gel cushioning, and outer traction grips deliver lasting control and comfort; session after session, wash after wash. It’s innovation inspired by movement—where the grace of dance meets the power of Pilates.<\/p>","layout":"vertical","vertical_alignment":"center","text_alignment":"center","logo_alignment":"center","spacing":40,"background_color":"#ffffff","title_color":"#0e0e0e","text_color":"#0e0e0e","title_size":20,"title_weight":"600","text_size":16,"title_margin_bottom":8,"padding":40,"border_radius":20,"mobile_layout":"horizontal","mobile_text_alignment":"center","mobile_logo_alignment":"center","mobile_logo_size":50,"mobile_title_size":24,"mobile_text_size":12,"mobile_spacing":16,"mobile_padding":20},"blocks":{}},"ai_gen_block_58c30fb_UQqNDk":{"type":"ai_gen_block_58c30fb","disabled":true,"settings":{"logo":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bloch_Active_Logo_BLACK.png","logo_size":130,"text":"<p>At BLOCH Active, performance is our passion. We create high-performance <a href=\"\/collections\/activewear\" title=\"Activewear\">activewear<\/a> and precision <a href=\"\/collections\/pilates-barre-grip-wear\" title=\"Pilates\/Barre Grip Wear\">Pilates grip wear<\/a> designed for strength, control, and movement that matters.<\/p><p>With our deep roots in dance, BLOCH understands the discipline and artistry that fuels every movement. That same intention shapes everything we make, from Pilates grip wear to sculpting <a href=\"\/collections\/active-leggings\" title=\"Active Pants & Leggings\">leggings<\/a> and supportive <a href=\"\/collections\/active-crop-tops\" title=\"Active Crop Tops & Sports Bras\">sports bras<\/a> to <a href=\"\/collections\/off-duty\" title=\"Off-Duty\">cozy layers<\/a> that take you effortlessly from studio to street. Each piece is thoughtfully crafted to elevate how you feel, inside and out.<\/p><p>Our <a href=\"\/collections\/pilates-barre-grip-wear\" title=\"Pilates\/Barre Grip Wear\">CoreGrip Pro Pilates Sock<\/a> represents the next evolution of performance footwear. More than a studio essential, it’s a revolution in grip footwear - precision engineered for ultimate stability. Featuring an advanced isometric knit and dual-layer non-slip technology, CoreGrip Pro locks your feet in place for maximum stability on any Pilates apparatus or floor surface. The anatomical left\/right design, inner gel cushioning, and outer traction grips deliver lasting control and comfort; session after session, wash after wash. It’s innovation inspired by movement—where the grace of dance meets the power of Pilates.<\/p>","text_size":16,"spacing":10,"padding":0,"border_radius":0,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#0e0e0e","mobile_layout":"column"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_7ed979e_EycrWh","ai_gen_block_58c30fb_UQqNDk"],"settings":{}}},"order":["176094812574b0b219","823a5c3a-2b16-44e3-ab17-e2127f916bec","split_image_Mkm7qm","split_image_Ejeixm","split_image_XtdwwN","featured_collection_AicUjc","split_image_rcxyqP","custom_liquid_8pNgbi","featured_collection_HCFDBV","image_with_text_tUDMzA","split_image_UBhcNR","featured_collection_kqGEe8","image_with_text_HLdjfj","164125096308affa56","3ef0e116-815a-4783-8326-95018a2741fb","image_with_text_CPPCaN","featured_collection_rMFJkU","multicolumn_4Nahe6","main","1df9e6b2-825a-47f5-b2f9-a4d95fbc8b46","176052652127f5ad43"]}